{"id":"7c25fd50a2ef301677b760a4b9e1ea4f22213eb5","axis":"silent","repo":"kestra-io/kestra","sha":"7c25fd50a2ef301677b760a4b9e1ea4f22213eb5","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"ui/AGENTS.md","lines":["@@ -426,7 +426,7 @@ If your `<style>` block needs to exist:"," |-----------|---------|"," | `KsCard` | Card container |"," | `KsTable` / `KsTableColumn` | Basic table |","-| `KsDataTable` / `KsFilter` / `KsBulkSelect` | Advanced data table with filtering, sorting, pagination, bulk actions. A filter key with `valueType: \"number\"` takes a number input; adding `Comparators.BETWEEN` to its comparators offers a min/max pair, sent as `GREATER_THAN_OR_EQUAL_TO` + `LESS_THAN_OR_EQUAL_TO` since the API has no between. A value option's `count` shows as a compact neutral badge next to it in the value lists. **Pagination is fully controlled** — bind `:currentPage` / `:pageSize` (or `v-model:`). See \"Data tables & pagination state\". Pass `mobileColumns` (`{leading?, title, titleAside?, meta?, metaAside?, actions?}`, each naming a column `prop`, or the `columnKey` of a prop-less actions column) to render a card per row below 768px: `leading` is a status dot, `title` is bold, `titleAside` sits on its right, `meta` columns share the second line joined by a dot and `metaAside` closes it; `actions` is a corner cell on the first line; unlisted columns are hidden, bulk selection is desktop-only (the selection column is not shown on cards), and the regular table returns from 768px. |","+| `KsDataTable` / `KsFilter` / `KsBulkSelect` | Advanced data table with filtering, sorting, pagination, bulk actions. A filter key with `valueType: \"number\"` takes a number input; adding `Comparators.BETWEEN` to its comparators offers a min/max pair, sent as `GREATER_THAN_OR_EQUAL_TO` + `LESS_THAN_OR_EQUAL_TO` since the API has no between. A value option's `count` shows as a compact neutral badge next to it in the value lists. A filter key with `valueType: \"radio\"` takes `allLabel` / `allDescription` to name and describe its default option; selecting it omits the filter from the query. **Pagination is fully controlled** — bind `:currentPage` / `:pageSize` (or `v-model:`). See \"Data tables & pagination state\". Pass `mobileColumns` (`{leading?, title, titleAside?, meta?, metaAside?, actions?}`, each naming a column `prop`, or the `columnKey` of a prop-less actions column) to render a card per row below 768px: `leading` is a status dot, `title` is bold, `titleAside` sits on its right, `meta` columns share the second line joined by a dot and `metaAside` closes it; `actions` is a corner cell on the first line; unlisted columns are hidden, bulk selection is desktop-only (the selection column is not shown on cards), and the regular table returns from 768px. |"," | `KsEntityLink` | Clickable cross-entity reference (namespace / flow) for table cells — neutral tag with leading icon, violet on hover. Pass `noIcon` in dense embedded tables (e.g. dashboard chart tables, ~90px columns) where the icon's 20px costs more than it tells |"," | `KsBadge` | Small indicator badge; `size=\"small\"` shrinks the pill so it sits on an icon button instead of covering it; `type=\"neutral\"` is a grey pill for counts next to content (the KsFilter value counts) |"," | `KsNewBadge` | Compact uppercase \"NEW\" pill flagging a newly shipped feature — caller supplies the label via the default slot |"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"ui/packages/design-system/src/components/Data/KsDataTable/KsFilter.locale.ts","lines":["@@ -69,6 +69,7 @@ export default {","             \"deselect all\": \"Deselect All\",","             \"no options found\": \"No options found\",","             \"show default\": \"Show Default\",","+            \"option_selected\": \"{label} selected\",","             \"operator\": \"Filter operator\",","             \"close\": \"Close\",","             \"remove_filter\": \"Remove filter\",","@@ -120,6 +121,8 @@ export default {","                 \"parent_desc